This should make the next "after 8 hours it died" report diagnosable without
guessing.

======================================================================
DATA RETENTION / COMPACTION
======================================================================

Review all runtime data that grows over long autonomous use.

Classify each:

DURABLE USER DATA
Never silently delete.

TRANSIENT RENDERER CACHE
May be bounded/unloaded.

DIAGNOSTIC LOGS
Rotate/retain according to policy.

COMPLETED EXECUTION TRANSIENTS
May be compacted after durable final state exists.

CHAT/SESSION CONTENT

Do not delete completed chats from durable storage merely because they are old.

But do not retain every historical conversation as live React/render/store state.

A session reopened later must hydrate from durable storage normally.

