======================================================================
IMPLEMENTATION PRINCIPLES
======================================================================

1. Do not trade correctness for low memory.

2. Do not delete user data to make graphs look pretty.

3. Do not periodically restart the whole app as the primary solution.

4. Do not run forced garbage collection in production as the fix.

5. Do not globally lower update frequency without proving the hot source.

6. Do not disable animations/sounds/features wholesale unless their measured
   implementation is the actual cause.

7. Fix the authoritative owner, not every consumer independently.

8. Bound every long-lived cache.

9. Every subscription/listener/timer has an explicit lifetime.

10. Every completed execution can eventually leave the hot working set.

